 "note": "Left side measured on the Getty / LAT photo 'Silverstone 14 July 1991, Robb Gravett' (near side-on, nose left; the model outline was traced from it, so positions read straight off it); colours and the rear quarter from the colour photo Super Touring Register 3243 (Brands Hatch), warped onto the model; checked against the TV graphic drawings and the season review frames. Red upper body, yellow lower body and boot spoiler, the bonnet pecten wrapping onto the front wing, big pecten across the door shut line, red Shell on the yellow, sponsor sticker list on the C-pillar. Wheels: white 5-spoke, from the pit-lane photo (Super Touring Register 2567, car standing). Uncertain: 'We race / You win' on the rear quarter shows in the Brands Hatch photo and the TV frames but not in the Silverstone July photos, drawn as in most references; the C-pillar sticker names are unreadable and drawn as yellow bars; the thin orange edge on the red/yellow line is approximate.",
